<title>USA: Franklin Resources sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Franklin Resources sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>SAN MATEO, Calif. 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Franklin Resources Inc said on Monday it set a three-for-two stock split, payable on January 15 to shareholders of record on December 31.</p>
</text>
